{
  "slug": "specforge",
  "name": "Specforge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SpecForge — compile natural-language requirements into spec.yaml bundles and implement from spec inside Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install specforge@claude-community` from `ferrarimarlon/specforge`.\n\nTurn a human request into a machine-executable contract — before the first line of code is written.\n\nSpecForge — compile natural-language requirements into spec.yaml bundles and implement from spec inside Claude Code.",
